    Socket::startPollLingeringClose(): the peer reads everything sent before the close, and the data it sends that
    was never read is discarded instead of making the system reset the connection.
*/

%modern

%prepend-module-path "${SCRIPT_DIR}/../../../../../qlib"
%requires QUnit

%exec-class SocketLingeringCloseTest

